WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.219
The next morning Snow White woke up.

2
00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:13.279
Seven faces stared at her.

3
00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:19.802
"Oh, my!" She sat up.

4
00:00:19.803 --> 00:00:23.444
"We won't hurt you!" the first dwarf said.

5
00:00:23.445 --> 00:00:25.498
"What's your name?"

6
00:00:25.499 --> 00:00:28.241
"Snow White," she said.

7
00:00:28.242 --> 00:00:32.165
"My name is Dar," the dwarf said.

8
00:00:32.166 --> 00:00:34.823
He introduced the other dwarfs.

9
00:00:34.824 --> 00:00:48.502
"This is Mar, Par, Gar, Zar, Yar, and Star!"

10
00:00:48.503 --> 00:00:51.616
All the dwarfs stared at Snow White.

11
00:00:51.617 --> 00:00:55.002
"Where are you from?" Mar asked.

12
00:00:55.003 --> 00:01:01.988
"Do you have a family?" Par asked.

13
00:01:01.989 --> 00:01:12.384
Snow White told the dwarfs her story.

14
00:01:12.385 --> 00:01:16.769
Gar bit his lip. "I never liked the new queen!"

15
00:01:16.770 --> 00:01:20.819
Zar nodded. "She's awful!"

16
00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:24.036
"The worst," Yar said.

17
00:01:24.037 --> 00:01:27.795
A tear fell from Star's eye.

18
00:01:27.796 --> 00:01:31.456
"That's the saddest story ever!

19
00:01:31.457 --> 00:01:35.199
Snow White, please stay here with us."

20
00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:39.690
Snow White smiled. "That sounds wonderful!"

21
00:01:39.691 --> 00:01:43.313
"We have to be careful," Dar said.

22
00:01:43.314 --> 00:01:52.028
"The queen must not learn that you're alive!"

23
00:01:52.029 --> 00:01:56.153
The dwarfs got ready for work.

24
00:01:56.154 --> 00:01:59.736
"We'll be back after dark," Dar said.

25
00:01:59.737 --> 00:02:02.583
"Don't let anyone in!"

26
00:02:02.584 --> 00:02:13.231
"Okay," Snow White promised.

27
00:02:13.232 --> 00:02:19.967
Snow White spent the day cleaning the house.

28
00:02:19.968 --> 00:02:27.366
By sunset, soup was cooking on the stove.

29
00:02:27.367 --> 00:02:29.419
Snow White smiled.

30
00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:38.807
"My new friends will be home soon!"

31
00:02:38.808 --> 00:02:43.506
Meanwhile the queen was standing in front of her mirror.

32
00:02:43.507 --> 00:02:46.800
She laughed loudly.

33
00:02:46.801 --> 00:02:50.597
"Now I'm the most beautiful woman in the kingdom.

34
00:02:50.598 --> 00:02:54.218
Right, Mirror?"

35
00:02:54.219 --> 00:02:57.688
"No, My Lady," the mirror said.

36
00:02:57.689 --> 00:03:07.318
"There is someone a thousand times more beautiful."

